## The Vintage Frame Rule

The Vintage Frame Rule measures cushion-to-band fit. It builds the heritage silhouette directly into the calculation.

A cushion cut is a square or slightly rectangular stone with soft rounded corners. Those corners are what give it the antique profile. At 1ct, [GIA](https://www.gia.edu/) measures a cushion modified brilliant at approximately 5.5mm × 5.5mm face-up. That is identical to a 1ct princess in width. But the shape reads completely differently. The rounded corners carry the visual weight to the center. The stone glows rather than sparkles.

The Vintage Frame Rule has two parts:

**Part 1 — Band Coverage:** Cushion width ÷ band width × 100 = coverage percentage. A 1ct cushion (5.5mm) on a 7mm band = 79% coverage. This is the heritage sweet spot — the stone fills the band without looking oversize.

**Part 2 — Corner Clearance:** Cushion corners are rounded, not pointed. Standard 4-prong round-head settings work correctly. No V-prong specification needed. The prong seats at the rounded corner with natural contact. The risk of corner chipping — the main issue with princess cut — does not apply to cushion.

| Carat | Face-Up Width | 7mm Band Coverage | Prong Type Needed | What this means |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0.75 ct | ~5.1mm | 73% | Standard round-head | Minimum viable; stone looks slightly small on 7mm |
| 1.00 ct | ~5.5mm | 79% | Standard round-head | Ideal for 6–7mm band; heritage sweet spot |
| 1.25 ct | ~5.9mm | 84% | Standard round-head | Strong presence; correct on 7mm band |
| 1.50 ct | ~6.3mm | 90% | Standard round-head | Maximum for standard 7mm; dominant presence |
| [1.5ct IGI E-VVS2 lab — $1,422](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28961887?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | ~6.3mm | 90% | Standard round-head | Best value at this size; IGI certified |

**Verdict:** The Vintage Frame Rule targets 1ct cushion (5.5mm) as the ideal center stone for 6–7mm men's band widths. It delivers 79–84% band coverage and no corner vulnerability. Pair a [1ct GIA G-VS1 cushion at $1,891](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/23740863?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) with the [Structured Solitaire at $1,732](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/mens-structured-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-item-147399?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) for a $3,623 complete ring.

