## Cushion vs Round vs Princess for Men

| Shape | 1ct Natural Price | Corner Risk | Prong Required | Band Coverage (7mm) | Vintage Read |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Cushion | [$1,891](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/23740863?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | None — rounded corners | Standard round-head | 79% | High — heritage silhouette |
