| **What this means** | Cushion is cheapest natural | No special prong needed | Standard setting works | Same footprint as princess | Best for heritage/antique look |

**Verdict:** Cushion gives you the vintage look, no corner risk, and the lowest natural stone price in certified inventory. Round costs 41% more with no vintage aesthetic. Princess matches cushion on price but requires V-prong heads and carries chip risk. For a men's ring where the stone must signal heritage — cushion wins. For cushion in women's settings, see the full [cushion cut diamond guide](/category/cushion-cut-diamond). For men's shape comparisons, see the [men's round diamond ring guide](/mens-round-diamond-ring) and [men's princess cut ring guide](/mens-princess-cut-ring).

